# /pre-market

> Skills below exist in skills/ — read their SKILL.md and run scripts directly.
> Do not create anything. Do not install anything.
> skills/market-breadth-analyzer/ | skills/uptrend-analyzer/ | skills/sector-analyst/

Run steps in order. Save full output to reports/logs/market_context_YYYY-MM-DD.md.

---

## STEP 1 — MARKET POSTURE

Run these three skills. Report one line each — score and key signal only:
- market-breadth-analyzer → composite score + zone
- uptrend-analyzer → composite score + any warnings
- sector-analyst → leading sector + cycle phase

## STEP 2 — CALENDAR

```bash
python3 scripts/fred_calendar.py --days 3 --format brief
```
Report HIGH impact events only. One line: DATE | EVENT
Skip LOW and MEDIUM entirely.

If FMP active: run earnings-calendar. Report only earnings within 5 days
on tickers held in Portfolio A or B, or >5% QQQ/SPY weight. Skip the rest.

## STEP 3 — POSITION FLAGS

Check state/theses/ for open positions. Flag:

URGENT — report first:
- Options expiring ≤ 7 days
- Price breached logged stop level

WATCH — report second:
- Options expiring ≤ 14 days
- Earnings within 5 days on held underlying

Format: [URGENT/WATCH] TICKER | reason | stop/target for reference

## STEP 4 — OUTPUT BLOCK

Print exactly this. No prose around it:

```
Date:            YYYY-MM-DD
Breadth:         X/100 (zone)
Uptrend:         X/100
Leading sector:  X
Macro events:    X or none
Earnings watch:  X or none
Flags:           X or none
Posture:         NEW_ENTRY_ALLOWED / CAUTIOUS / REDUCE_ONLY
Ceiling:         X%
Watch today:     [one sentence]
```

Posture rules:
- Breadth > 60, no macro event today → NEW_ENTRY_ALLOWED, 70%
- Breadth 40-60 OR macro event today → CAUTIOUS, 50%
- Breadth < 40 OR any URGENT flag → REDUCE_ONLY, 30%
- FTD conflict: use lower ceiling (playbook.md)

## STEP 5 — LOG

Append posture block to reports/logs/market_context_YYYY-MM-DD.md

Append one line to reports/logs/posture_history.log:
YYYY-MM-DD | breadth | uptrend | posture | ceiling% | watch_today
